    "public_url": "internships/social-media-marketing-internship-skill3x-1763253",
    "title": "Social Media Marketing Internship",
    "organization_id": 2066560,
    "type": "jobs",
    "subtype": "internships",
    "regn_open": 1,
    "updated_at": "2026-09-29T22:54:06+05:30",
    "region": "online",
    "visibility": "public",
    "details": "<p><strong>About the Company</strong></p>\n<p>SKILL3X is offering an opportunity for an aspiring marketer to gain practical exposure to social media marketing in a flexible, remote work environment. The internship is designed for someone who is curious about digital communities, enjoys creating engaging content, and wants to build hands-on experience across social platforms.</p>\n<p><strong>Responsibilities</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Support the planning and execution of social media content across relevant platforms.</li>\n<li>Assist with creating, editing, and scheduling posts, captions, stories, and campaign assets.</li>\n<li>Monitor audience engagement, comments, trends, and competitor activity to identify useful insights.</li>\n<li>Help maintain a consistent brand voice and contribute ideas for improving reach and interaction.</li>\n<li>Track basic performance metrics and prepare concise updates on content and campaign results.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Interest in social media, digital marketing, content creation, or online communities.</li>\n<li>Strong written communication, creativity, attention to detail, and willingness to learn.</li>\n<li>Ability to work independently, manage deadlines, and collaborate through remote communication.</li>\n<li>No prior professional experience is required; academic projects, personal pages, or portfolio work are welcome.</li>\n<li>This is a 3-month unpaid internship with performance-based incentives and flexible working hours.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Work arrangement:</strong> Remote, work-from-home. The intern will receive practical exposure to social media marketing workflows, content performance, and campaign coordination while working with the SKILL3X team.</p>",
