    "region": "online",
    "visibility": "public",
    "details": "<p><strong>About the Company:</strong></p>\n<p>Xtragrad Technologie Private Limited is a dynamic technology firm focused on innovation and growth. We are committed to providing cutting-edge solutions and fostering talent in the tech industry. Join us to gain hands-on experience and contribute to impactful projects.</p>\n<p><strong>Responsibilities:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Assist in the development and implementation of AI models and algorithms.</li>\n<li>Conduct research and analysis to support AI initiatives.</li>\n<li>Collaborate with team members on various projects.</li>\n<li>Contribute to the documentation and testing of AI solutions.</li>\n<li>Learn and apply new AI technologies and methodologies.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Requirements:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Currently enrolled in a relevant academic program (e.g., Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Data Science).</li>\n<li>Basic understanding of AI/ML concepts and principles.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with programming languages such as Python.</li>\n<li>Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.</li>\n<li>Ability to work independently and as part of a team.</li>\n<li>Enthusiasm for learning and contributing to AI projects.</li>\n</ul>",
